# `pnx convex dev` writes CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT / CONVEX_URL here after you log in.
#
# App config is set on the Convex deployment, not in this file (read as
# process.env.NAME inside functions / auth.config.ts):
#   pnx convex env set CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN https://<your-subdomain>.clerk.accounts.dev
#   pnx convex env set CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET   whsec_...   # Clerk dashboard → Webhooks
#
# Optional — where `infrastructure/jobs/webhooks.ts` POSTs outbound events. Unset is a
# supported state: deliveries are skipped rather than retried and failed.
#   pnx convex env set OUTBOUND_WEBHOOK_URL   https://example.com/hooks/convex
#
# Required for `features/assistant` (Mistral via the AI SDK). Missing is fine
# until the first `ask`; tests mock the model and never read this.
#   pnx convex env set MISTRAL_API_KEY        <your key>
